e line-120 fix and add a regression test covering `$name`, `${…}`, `{$…}`, `$tag$…$tag$` and `\\$`.","ttft_ms":2926,"type":"result","duration_ms":35317,"uuid":"fc99caa3-fbbc-4fb5-a7d0-49785cb4354f","ttft_stream_ms":2412,"time_to_request_ms":426,"first_content_frame_ms":2412,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-23T22:59:00.503Z"}

